    "turn_idx": 68,
    "turn_text": "It's never been done. And it can be done. And so I remember the pressure of that. There's a lot of well-meaning friends who said, don't know if the voters are ready. We really need the seat in my house seat. It was a pick up from a moderate Republican who had retired. You know, it might have not been the first choice of those who were recruiting",
